    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Lords of the Forge",
    "summary": "**TECH-PRIEST** models of yours have a 4+ **[InSv](vsdata:core-rule/save-rolls)**, **[Feel No Pain 5+](vsdata:core-ability/feel-no-pain)** and Baffling Data Screed: during your Shooting phase, when the model's unit gets **selected to shoot** while not **battle-shocked**, you may roll 1 D6. On a 2+, pick 1:\n\n- 1 enemy **VEHICLE** unit no more than 12\" from the model's unit has to take a **battle-shock roll** at −1. Each enemy unit can be picked this way only once per turn.\n- The unit's ranged attacks do not stop it being **hidden**.",
